{"synopsis":"Dewa Pedang, Ahn Su-ho. Anehnya, pemain pendekar pedang terhebat umat manusia adalah seorang pemburu pegawai negeri yang berafiliasi dengan Asosiasi Pemburu Korea. Su-ho memilih jalur pegawai negeri semata-mata untuk mengakhiri gerbang. Mungkin itu sebabnya? Ketika salah satu gerbang tingkat bencana, yang disebut gerbang terakhir, diserang, dalam kejadian yang ironis, dia dikhianati oleh rekan-rekannya. “Akan lebih baik jika dia bergabung dengan kami sejak awal. Pegawai negeri sangat keras kepala.” Alasan rekan-rekannya mengkhianatinya? Karena jika gerbang ditutup, pengaruh mereka akan hilang. Apakah ini akhirnya? Saat kesadaran Su-ho mulai memudar, \\[Me-reboot sistem pemain Ahn Su- ho.] Sistem memberi Su-ho satu kesempatan lagi untuk kembali ke masa lalu dan mengatur segalanya dengan benar.","alternative_title":"Return of the Sword God-Rank Civil Servant 검신급 공무원의 회귀","author":"Gaetgangu, Zary","artist":"Studio Neulbom","chapters":[{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"02942f23-daf7-4c34-818e-db7d61b3cbef","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"94","chapter":"94","slug":"b49ee6db-e634-4be0-a8ab-2dc870acbad4","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-06-05"},{"number":"93","chapter":"93","slug":"7d98b86e-b9df-4114-a0ed-6138e228b7a3","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-05-30"},{"number":"92","chapter":"92","slug":"c3e62a6c-0d8d-4a91-960c-e5c9278e4bfb","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-05-23"},{"number":"91","chapter":"91","slug":"d1778a70-96eb-460f-ab42-8aff20e533e9","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-05-15"},{"number":"90","chapter":"90","slug":"145c2c57-e44b-4f39-a932-4c7e336fc1e2","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-05-09"},{"number":"89","chapter":"89","slug":"d803dd5d-f865-4b25-a9d6-470c0e41dcfc","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-05-03"},{"number":"88","chapter":"88","slug":"45fcf9de-eb7e-41a0-82ee-c4b0568eaf01","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-04-24"},{"number":"87","chapter":"87","slug":"e733f43b-b4bc-4969-8fde-ab70d2d01850","title":"Chapter 87"